{"id": "70297", "title": "无爱言婚", "author": "叶落无心", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70297/70297s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70297.htm", "intro": "那一年，我十五岁：\r\n    “哥，我想问你个问题。”\r\n    “嗯，问吧。”\r\n    “如果我爱上一个男人，很爱，很爱，可他好像不爱我，我该怎么办？”\r\n    “很简单，用尽一切方法得到他，让他爱上你。”\r\n    “……如果我能做的都做了，他还是不爱我呢？”\r\n    “那你告诉我他是谁，我会让他永远没有机会爱上别的女人。”\r\n    “为什么？”\r\n    “我不想看见你伤心……”\r\n    闷骚哥哥和可爱妹妹的四味爱情——酸、甜、苦、辣，爱过才知滋味浓！\r\n    文艺版文案：有人说，人一辈子总要做几件让自己后悔莫及的事，人生才完整，\r\n    迄今为止，我只做过两件让自己人生完整的事，\r\n    一件事是爱上我的哥哥，\r\n    另一件事，是嫁给了他……", "base": "files/article/html/70/70297", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "序幕 （上）", "file": "10923052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "序幕 （下）【修改】", "file": "10923053.html", "available": false}, {"title": "婚礼【新增】", "file": "10923054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "洞房【修改】", "file": "10923055.html", "available": false}, {"title": "疼爱【修改】", "file": "10923056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "家风", "file": "10923057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "爬窗", "file": "10923058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "吃醋", "file": "10923059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情人【修改】", "file": "10923060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "抉择【小修】", "file": "10923061.html", "available": false}, {"title": "回房", "file": "10923062.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小别", "file": "10923063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "表白", "file": "10923064.html", "available": false}, {"title": "实习【增加】", "file": "10923065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小聚【补全】", "file": "10923066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "酒局", "file": "10923067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相聚", "file": "10923068.html", "available": true}, {"title": "爱情", "file": "10923069.html", "available": true}, {"title": "番外之 平安夜", "file": "10923070.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10923071.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10923381.h